{
  "id": 21014,
  "entry": "r0341",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "r0341",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔方相回来了。此行可有所得。",
      "next": "r0342",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0342",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "嗯，轮回堂的簿子被改过。",
      "next": "r0343",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0343",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "轮回堂的簿子？何人敢改。",
      "next": "r0344",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0344",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不知道。墨分两色。我念，你翻旧档。",
      "next": "r0346",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0346",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "奇了。",
      "next": "r0347",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0347",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "如何。",
      "next": "r0348",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0348",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "这七人，官府死亡名册上均是有载，皆在三千七百人之列。死得明白，并无异常。",
      "next": "r0349",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0349",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那改的是什么。",
      "next": "r0350",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0350",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "改的不是死籍，是赈籍。",
      "next": "r0352",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0352",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "【泾阳灾赈记录】",
      "next": "r0353",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0353",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "灾后开赈，逐年造册，每户一份。您看第三年这页——沈七，当日勾粮，勾了两次。",
      "next": "r0354",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0354",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "领两份。",
      "next": "r0355",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0355",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "七人尽数如此。妖界簿上多出来的墨，与赈粮册上重复领粮的名字，一一重合。",
      "next": "r0356",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0356",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0357",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0357",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "再论笔迹。添改之人写的是官样文书体，横平竖直，收笔回锋，是常年拟写公文的手。",
      "next": "r0358",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0358",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "官府的人。",
      "next": "r0359",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0359",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "至少曾食官俸。",
      "next": "r0360",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0360",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "名簿在轮回堂，动手的人在官府。这条线，得往泾阳查。",
      "next": "r0361",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0361",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "正是。镜中泾阳，大水后数年光景，怨魂盘踞，旧署还在，灾册散于其中。您此行若去，务必珍重。",
      "next": "r0362",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0362",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我有一事问你。",
      "next": "r0363",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0363",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔方相请讲。",
      "next": "r0364",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0364",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "殷红就是何素。她自己记得。唯独我的名字，她记不住。",
      "next": "r0365",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0365",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0366",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0366",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你早就知道。",
      "next": "r0367",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0367",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "您问案卷，在下知无不言。问起夫人，在下无可奉告。",
      "next": "r0368",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0368",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那换一样问。她记不住，是何原因？",
      "next": "r0369",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0369",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔方相。轮回，并非没有代价的方便之事。",
      "next": "r0370",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0370",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你是说，我的名字……",
      "next": "r0371",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0371",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "这只是一个微小的代价。",
      "next": "r0372",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0372",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0373",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0373",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "人间的何素已殁，妖界的殷红，迟早也会千般轮回。崔方相，莫过偏执。",
      "next": "r0374",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0374",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "没有，我只是查案。",
      "next": "r0375",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0375",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那便查案。",
      "next": "r0377",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0377",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "泾阳的旧档借我一用。",
      "next": "r0378",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0378",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不可。您要只能在此抄录。",
      "next": "r0379",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0379",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不必。我看过了。",
      "next": "r0380",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0380",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔方相……您入镜之后，行事处处凭着一股气。在下劝不得，只望您记得：镜中之人有镜中之命。查案可以，莫要动情。",
      "next": "r0382",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0382",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔方相，保重。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "End",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "",
      "next": "",
